{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56320","headline":"诗 · 李端公","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"却到城中事事伤，惠休归放贾生亡。\n谁人收得章句箧，独我重经苔藓房。\n一命未沾爲逐客，万缘初尽别空王。\n[□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□]。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷十四《炙毂子诗格》引。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端公","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}